  "summary": "PROVO, Utah --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Feb. 12, 2026-- Nu Skin Enterprises, Inc. (NYSE: NUS) today announced its board of directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.06 per share, which will be paid on Mar. 11, 2026, to shareholders of record on Feb. 27, 2026. About Nu Skin Enterprises Inc.",
